From 2358fbedc9885dd117a4b2e398257c4c2e875240 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 21:02:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Stream presences in GraphQL message subscriptions on request

stanza.subscribeForMessages skips every stanza except messages, so a
client using the subscription as its session can't follow room
occupants or contacts coming and going.

Add an optional 'presences' argument (false by default) to the user and
admin subscriptions. When true, presences sent to the session are
streamed as well, in the same StanzaMap format.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ETaRHXo1LmPHqZB9SXMucM
